      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil Central Bank PTAX, Selic, CDI & IPCA Contract Indexer Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nFetches official Central Bank of Brazil (BCB SGS & Olinda) macroeconomic series (Selic, CDI, IPCA, IGP-M, PTAX USD/EUR) and calculates automated B2B contract, lease, and treasury monetary adjustments.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/brazil-bcb-ptax-sgs-financial-contract-indexer](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/brazil-bcb-ptax-sgs-financial-contract-indexer)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: brazil-bcb-ptax-sgs-financial-contract-indexer** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "edd9d5ba-dd89-5b20-a69d-0893e73bc65b",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
